erschillende locaties over de hele wereld terwijl je puzzels oplost, vijanden verslaat en verborgen schatten ontdekt in een filmisch avontuur.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"333\"><strong data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"333\">Staat</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"349\">In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"362\">⭐ Voordelen</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"553\">• Avontuurlijke actiegame met sterk verhaal<br data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"410\">• Filmische gameplay en indrukwekkende omgevingen<br data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"462\">• Afwisseling tussen actie, puzzels en verkenning<br data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"514\">• Geschikt voor singleplayer avontuur</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"571\">📋 Specificaties</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"793\"><strong data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"586\">Platform:</strong> PlayStation 4<br data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"603\"><strong data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"613\">Titel:</strong> Uncharted 4: A Thief’s End<br data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"643\"><strong data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"653\">Genre:</strong> Action / Adventure<br data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"675\"><strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"689\">Spelmodus:</strong> Singleplayer / Multiplayer<br data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"719\"><strong data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"732\">Uitgever:</strong> Sony Interactive Entertainment<br data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"766\"><strong data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"776\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"809\">📦 Meegeleverd</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"839\">Game disc<br data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"823\">Origineel doosje</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"859\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"893\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\